# Saranidhi — local environment template.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored — NEVER commit the real .env) and
# fill in the real values on your machine. The values below are placeholders.
#
#   cp .env.example .env    # then edit .env with the real secret
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vercel Deployment Protection — bypass for automated QA-Verify (Antigravity).
#
# Enabled at: Vercel dashboard → project `saranidhi` → Settings →
# Deployment Protection → "Protection Bypass for Automation".
# Protection stays ON for humans; automated agents pass this secret to reach the
# protected preview. Used by the QA-Verify smoke test on release-branch previews.
#
# QA-Verify uses it as a QUERY PARAM on the preview URL (browser navigation):
#   https://<preview-host>/?x-vercel-protection-bypass=$VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET&x-vercel-set-bypass-cookie=true
# (the set-bypass-cookie param keeps in-app navigation bypassed for the whole run)
VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET=your_vercel_bypass_secret_here
